sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant SB as SearchBar
    participant VM as SearchSuggestVM
    participant REC as Recents(DataStore)
    participant API as SuggestApi
    User->>SB: focuses empty box
    VM->>REC: observe recents
    REC-->>SB: ZeroQuery(recents, trending)
    User->>SB: types sho
    SB->>VM: onQueryChanged(sho)
    Note over VM: debounce 300ms then flatMapLatest
    VM->>VM: merge recents matching sho immediately
    VM-->>SB: Typing(local merged, loadingRemote=true)
    VM->>API: suggest(sho)
    API-->>VM: shoe rack, shorts men
    VM->>VM: merge + dedup + rank
    VM-->>SB: Typing(merged, loadingRemote=false)
    User->>SB: taps shoe rack
    SB->>VM: onSelect(shoe rack)
    VM->>REC: add(shoe rack)
    Note over VM: run search Ch 9 and navigate to results
